<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- WolioNT</book>
  <para style="ide">65001 - Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">FILEMON</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemon</para>
  <para style="toc1">SURANA PAUL TO FILEMON</para>
  <para style="mt2">SURANA PAUL</para>
  <para style="mt2">TO</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILEMON</para>
  <para style="is">POGAU BHAA-BHAANA</para>
  <para style="im">Filemon satotuuna o miana Karasiteni motokailiili momembalina anggotana jamaʼa i kota Kolose. Incia dhaangia tee bhatuana mokosaroakana Onesimus. Bhatua sii apalai minaaka i Filemon opuna sumai, kasiimpo inda tee momataua tuaapa ipomatauakana tee Paul wakutuuna Paul dhaangiapo i nuncana katorongku. Onesimus aparacaea tee Isa roonamo kaadharina Paul.</para>
  <para style="ip">I nuncana<char style="bk">Surana Paul To Filemon</char> sii o Paul aemani mpuu mamudhaakana o Filemon aunda apomalape pendua tee Onesimus. Onesimus sii o bhatuana motangasaana mombulina roonamo Paul atumpua mboo sumai. Paul aemani mamudhaakana o Filemon aunda atarima pendua Onesimus, mencuana tangkanamo mboomo o bhatuana mopadhana imaʼafuaka, maka rampaakanamo Onesimus uka samia witinai saʼagama Karasiteni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Antona</para>
  <para style="io1">Porikanaana pogau <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kaasi tee iimanina Filemon <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iemanina mpuu to Onesimus <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Katutubhi <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Salamu</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Minaaka i Paul, mia itorongku rampaakanamo Isa Al Masi, tee Timotius, witinaita saʼagama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">To Filemon imaasiakamami tee sabhangkamami takarajaa, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>to Apfia, witinaita bhawine, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:17">Kol. 4:17</ref>.</char></note>to Arkhipus sabhangkata mopobhawa-bhawana tapoewangiaka bhari-bharia masaʼala, tee manga jamaʼa modhaangiana i bhanuamu.<verse eid="PHM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Maasangia rahumati tee dhadhi malape minaaka i Aulataʼala, Amata, tee minaaka i Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga apobhawa tee ingkoo.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaasi tee Iimanina Filemon</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Iaku sadia kusukuru i Aulataʼala wakutuuna kuudhani saromu i nuncana doʼaku, <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>roonamo kurangoa o lelemu atotuu-totuu uparacaea tee Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga, tee umaasiaka bhari-bharia mia mosaalihi. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Iaku kudoʼa maasangia o powitinaita i nuncana iimanita tee Isa bheakohasiliaka maʼana molabhina kaogena to bhari-bharia kabarakati momembalina pewauata roonamo taposaangu tee Al Masi. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>E witinaiku, iaku kukaunde-unde mpuu roonamo kaasimu tee upekatangkaaku, roonamo padhamo uhiburu ngangarandana manga mia mosaalihi.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iemanina Paul i Filemon Pokaiana tee Onesimus</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>I nuncana sarona Isa Al Masi, satotuuna iaku kubarani kudhawuakako parinta tee opea tabeana ipewaumu, <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>maka roonamo kuudhani kaasi, sumaimo iaku salabhina kuemani i ingkoo. Iaku o Paul, kukoʼumurumo tee sii-sii kutotorongku roonamo Isa Al Masi. <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:9">Kol. 4:9</ref>. </char></note>Rampaakanamo sumai dhaangia tee iemaniku i ingkoo pokaiana tee Onesimus. Incia amembalimo mboomo anaku karoku, roonamo incia aparacaea tee Al Masi alaloi kaadhariku wakutuuna kutotorongku. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Wakutuuna incia dhaangiapo amembali bhatuamu, inciamo incia 'Inda Akoguna' to ingkoo, maka sii-sii incia 'Akogunamo' mpuu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Inda Akoguna...Akogunamo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saro Onesimus sii o maʼanana 'akoguna,' apokana mboomo sarona Gunawan i nuncana pogau Malau. I nuncana aeati incia sii, Paul apake ibarati, roonamo i piamo itu Onesimus sii o mia momangare, atawa roonamo incia apalaiaka karona minaaka i Filemon, sumaimo sarona alabhi acoco 'Inda akoguna.' Maka roonamo Onesimus amembalimo witinai saʼagama, sumaimo wakutuuna o Paul apogau to rua mpearona, sarona mobhaa-bhaana i saao acocomo pendua. Kamatea uka i aeati </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:20">20</ref>. </char></note> malape to iaku atawa to ingkoo.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Sii-sii o anaana imaasiakaku sii kutumpumea ambuli pendua tee ingkoo. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Satotuuna iaku gauku kutaangia to alaianiaka iaku to kupamembalia kabholosimu, wakutuuna iaku dhaangiapo i nuncana katorongku to Lele Malape minaaka i Aulataʼala. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Maka iaku kumendeu kupewau opeopea uka ande indapo usatujuia, roonamo kumendeu kupakisaako to upewau giu momalape, ande inda aminaaka i karelana totona incamu. <verse eid="PHM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Aipomo siimo mbakana incia apapogaaia sabantara minaaka i ingkoo, mamudhaakana amembali utarimaia to saʼumurua. <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>Sii-sii, incia mencuana soo samia bhatua, maka amembalimo witinaita saʼagama. Ande iaku kumaasiakea, dhaanamo kamaasiakamu ahanda mpuu tee incia, roonamo incia o anggotana rumatanggamu tee uka ingkomiu uposaangumo i nuncana Kawasana Opu.<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Rampaakanamo sumai, ande uabhiaku sabhangkamu saʼiimani, utarimamea incia mboomo utarima iaku. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Ande incia tee kasalahana atawa dhaangia tee dhosana i ingkoo, taroakamo iaku motanggoa bhari-bharia sumai. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Iaku o Paul, minaaka i kaburina limaku sii kujaminia: Iaku bhemopomeaia. Bholimo kuudhaniakako pokaiana dhosamu i iaku, siitumo dhadhimu abhaau umembali mia moparacaeana tee Isa. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>E witinaiku, ingkita tamembalimo witinai roonamo Isa Al Masi, sabutuna i nuncana posaanguata tee Kawasana Opu, iaku kuemani mpuu upewaumea o iemaniku sumai, mamudhaakana o ngangarandaku atanangi.<verse eid="PHM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Kuburia o sura sii to ingkoo roonamo kuyaakini tee kataʼatimu. Iaku kumatauko bheupewau alabhi minaaka iemaniku. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Tee uka, kuemani tulungi upasadiaakaaku kamara to iaku i bhanuamu, roonamo kuharapu i Aulataʼala rampaakana manga doʼamiu iaku bhekumbuli pendua tee ingkomiu.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pogau Kapadhaa</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:12">4:12</ref>.</char>
    </note>Salamu to ingkoo minaaka i Epafras, sabhangkaku i nuncana katorongku roonamo sarona Isa Al Masi. <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Tul. 12:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:25">12:25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol. 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:14">4:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10-11">2Tim. 4:10-11</ref>.</char></note>Salamu to ingkoo uka minaaka i manga sabhangkamami sakarajaa mosagaanana siitumo, Markus, Aristarkhus, Demas, tee Lukas.<verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Rahumatina Isa Al Masi Oputa Momalanga apoose tee ingkomiu bhari-bharikomiu.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="restore"/>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
